                  "sourceContextAndLimits": "SH2022 pp18/40 requires actual model selection/use, observations, limits and also changes/model development. The whole current goal retains hypothesis-guided analogue OR digital work and justified need for development; it does not itself certify the additional completed-development operator or all source digital/experimental partners. The explicitly chosen original digital route retains own implementation/file/all six tests; analogue own card/rule records are not digital evidence.",
